flowchart LR
    U[User Goal]
    H[Harness<br/>Context · Policy · Runtime · State / Events]
    M[Model<br/>text or Candidate Action]
    P{Policy<br/>is this action allowed?}
    R[Runtime<br/>validated execution]
    E[Environment<br/>files · processes · network · permissions]
    O[Observation<br/>environment response]
    V[Validation / Evidence<br/>state checks and reviewable material]
    S[Human Review / Stop<br/>goal · evidence · risk · budget]
    C[Context]

    U --> H
    H --> C
    C --> M
    M -->|candidate only| H
    H --> P
    P -->|allow| R
    P -->|deny / ask| S
    R --> E
    E --> O
    O --> H
    H --> V
    V --> S
    S -->|continue with new context| H

    subgraph LOGIC[逻辑目标架构，不代表全部已实现]
      H
      C
      P
      R
      V
    end

    subgraph NOW[当前仓库：已实现并验证的 M0–M2]
      M0[M0 model call]
      M1[M1 unified protocol]
      M2[M2 tool runtime / one step]
    end
    M0 -. evidence .-> M
    M1 -. evidence .-> H
    M2 -. evidence .-> R

    subgraph P0REF[P0 组合参考：确定性切片，不是逐章完成]
      P0[P0 reference slice<br/>in-process · deterministic]
    end
    P0 -. composition reference .-> H

    subgraph FUTURE[M3–M10：尚未逐章实现的路线]
      F[M3 loop → M10 extensions]
    end
    F -. route only .-> H

    classDef logic fill:#eef6ff,stroke:#4779a8,color:#17324d
    classDef now fill:#edf8ed,stroke:#4d8b4d,color:#214d21
    classDef ref fill:#fff7e6,stroke:#b07a18,color:#5d4100
    classDef future fill:#f2f2f2,stroke:#777,color:#444,stroke-dasharray: 5 5
    class U,H,M,P,R,E,O,V,S,C logic
    class M0,M1,M2 now
    class P0 ref
    class F future
